# ── Keep these (explicitly tracked) ──────────────────────────────────────
# backend/static/signs/**  → all SVG assets ARE committed (generated, not sensitive)
# backend/sign_mapping.json → committed
# api/sign_mapping.json     → committed (Vercel deployment copy)
# public/                   → committed (Vercel static assets)
# requirements.txt          → committed
# vercel.json               → committed
# generate_signs.py         → committed (useful for contributors to regenerate signs)
